But `tmp` was allocated with `gnutls_malloc` (which is `malloc`), so the bytes beyond `slen` are uninitialized. However, `_gnutls_x509_decode_string` only reads `slen` bytes from `tmp`, so it shouldn't read uninitialized memory.

